                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">What you buy</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Total</th>
                <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Where and when</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">1. Pad under your own desk (budget)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">UREVO Smart Walking Pad $132.99 + VTORY 55 x 23.6 in. mat $19.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $153</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Amazon, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">1. Pad under your own desk (mid)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">WalkingPad Z1 $265.04 + WalkingPad 63 x 32.3 in. mat $54.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $320</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Amazon, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">2. Pad + rolling walking-pad stand</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">UREVO pad $132.99 + HOMELYM 30&ndash;47 in. stand $62.99 + mat $19.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $216</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Amazon, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">2. Pad + budget electric desk</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">UREVO pad $132.99 + FLEXISPOT E6 55 x 28 in. $243.66 + mat $19.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $397</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Amazon, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">2. Pad + mid-range desk</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">WalkingPad P1 $312.55 + Vari Classic 60 x 30 in. $580.30 + WalkingPad mat $54.99</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $948</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Amazon, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">2. Office-grade pad + desk, separately</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">LifeSpan TR1200Pro Glow-Up $1,199 + LifeSpan SD900 desk $849</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$2,048</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">LifeSpan store, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">2. Heavy-duty pad + premium desk</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">LifeSpan TX6 $1,399 + UPLIFT V3 laminate desk from $718</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">From $2,117</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Amazon, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">3. Integrated: LifeSpan TR1200-Omni</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Treadmill, desk and desktop console as one set</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$2,048</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">LifeSpan store, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">3. Integrated: InMovement Unsit bundle</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Unsit treadmill + Unsit Standing Desk</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$2,965&ndash;$3,165</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">InMovement store, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">3. Integrated: iMovR Unsit + Lander</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Unsit $2,595 + Lander 30 x 53 in. laminate desk $1,245</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $3,840</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">iMovR store, 24 Nov 2026</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table></div>
          <p>
            Prices exclude tax and delivery. Amazon prices are the listed price on the day; maker prices are the
            figure shown on the store, which on LifeSpan and InMovement was a sale price against a higher
            &ldquo;compare at&rdquo; figure. Setup 1 assumes your current desk already rises high enough over a pad;
            many do not, and the cheapest fix is often the desk, not the pad.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="walking-pads" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Walking Pad Prices for Desk Use</h2>
<p>
            The walking pad is the part that moves, wears and decides how long you can walk each day. For desk use the
            things that matter are a slow, fine speed range, a belt wide enough that you are not watching your feet,
            a weight rating with margin, and a motor meant to run for hours. Here is what each price level buys,
            from the Amazon listings and LifeSpan&rsquo;s store on 24 November 2026.
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[680px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead><tr><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Walking pad</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Price</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Speed</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Max user</th><th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Other figures stated by the seller</th></tr></thead>
