            the deck height. Turn that round and each desk&rsquo;s top height tells you roughly the tallest user it suits.
            The last column below does that sum for a 4.1-inch deck (UREVO and <a href="/walkingpad-z1-review/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium" data-autolink>WalkingPad Z1</a>) unless noted; it is an
            estimate from average proportions, so measure your own elbow height before you buy.
          </p>
