              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">ErGear 63 x 28 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$159.99 (Amazon)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">28.35&ndash;46.46 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Not stated in bullets</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">5 ft 5 in.</td></tr>
