              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">InMovement Unsit Treadmill Desk Bundle</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$2,965&ndash;$3,165 (compare at $3,215&ndash;$3,415)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Unsit + Unsit Standing Desk, 48 x 24 or 60 x 30 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Unsit alone $2,345 (compare at $2,595)</td></tr>
